Package: jarvisd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: systemd, dbus-user-session, jarvis-pkg (= @VERSION@), jarvis-diag (= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: Jarvis daemon (agent brain) for @DISTRO_NAME@, with bundled Node 24
 The Jarvis agent: model providers, the tool loop, the risk gate, the
 network doctor and the audit log, run as a systemd user service in every
 user session. Ships its own Node 24 runtime under /usr/lib/jarvis/node.
